  "title": "Evidence-Backed Video Question Answering",
  "summary": "E-VQA, a novel task requiring models to jointly output semantic answers and precise spatio-temporal evidence, introduces ST-Evidence as the first human-verified benchmark for pixel-level grounding. Evaluations show significant gains over baselines, with scalable pipelines bridging high-level reasoning and fine-grained grounding.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "E-VQA combines semantic answers with spatio-temporal evidence (temporal segments and tracked object masks) to address video dynamics.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "ST-Evidence is the first human-verified benchmark for discriminative and generative pixel-level grounding.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Fine-tuning grounded Video LLMs on ST-Evidence-Instruct achieves +27.2 t-mean and +13.8 J/F gains over UniPixel baselines.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
